        "q": "Should I sum StepsRecord values from readRecords to get a daily step total?",
        "a": "No. Google's read guide says that for cumulative types like StepsRecord you should use aggregate() instead of readRecords() to avoid double counting from multiple sources and improve accuracy. Several apps and devices can write steps for the same period, and summing the raw records counts each of them, while the aggregate API applies Health Connect's own handling of duplicate data."
